    thinking: "**Verifying GK Services**\n\nI\'ve established \"GK Services\" as the core of this project, ensuring I\'m on track with the prompt\'s first condition. Now, I need to thoroughly assess the remaining thirteen conditions. I\'m focusing on a clean implementation for `src/App.tsx`, and making sure this fulfills the conditions.\n\n\n**Defining Responsive Design**\n\nI\'ve nailed down the responsive font sizing using Orbitron, Rajdhani, Inter, and JetBrains Mono with rules in `index.css` and Tailwind. I\'m satisfied with how it handles the responsive size requirements. I\'ve chosen Electric Cyber Cyan and Deep Void Obsidian as the primary and secondary colors, accented with Titanium Steel for a professional palette.\n\n\n\n**Implementing Section Designs**\n\nI\'ve completed Section 6: Client Telemetry, Fleet Testimonials, Zero-Tolerance Guarantee, and FAQ. I\'ve got the sticky header with the three divisions, logo, navigation, and contact button, which all has a universal glowing effect. All sections are distinct and engaging and futuristic. The footer is also professional, with all the necessary details. I\'ve also implemented the hover effect on the y-axis, defined in `src/index.css`.\n\n\n**Applying Hover Effects**\n\nI\'ve just finished the hover effects, using the `.gk-hover-lift` class for cards, feature containers, bays, and calculators. I\'ve also implemented the responsive navigation, switching from a desktop menu to a cyber hamburger menu and sliding drawer. The site now features curated, high-resolution automotive imagery with `referrerPolicy=\"no-referrer\"`. Finally, I\'ve created a `CodePreviewAndZipModal.tsx` for 1-click ZIP generation and a code previewer with copy features. The overall impression is now decidedly futuristic.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_2268094"
      name: "create_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Content\":\"import React, { useState } from \'react\';\\nimport { Header } from \'./components/Header\';\\nimport { HeroSection } from \'./components/HeroSection\';\\nimport { Car360Viewer } from \'./components/Car360Viewer\';\\nimport { ServicesSection } from \'./components/ServicesSection\';\\nimport { TechBaySection } from \'./components/TechBaySection\';\\nimport { CostCalculatorSection } from \'./components/CostCalculatorSection\';\\nimport { TestimonialsFaqSection } from \'./components/TestimonialsFaqSection\';\\nimport { Footer } from \'./components/Footer\';\\nimport { BeforeAfterModal } from \'./components/BeforeAfterModal\';\\nimport { ContactModal } from \'./components/ContactModal\';\\nimport { CodePreviewAndZipModal } from \'./components/CodePreviewAndZipModal\';\\nimport { CarHotspot } from \'./types\';\\nimport { CAR_HOTSPOTS } from \'./data/mockCarData\';\\n\\nexport default function App() {\\n  const [selectedHotspot, setSelectedHotspot] = useState<CarHotspot | null>(null);\\n  const [contactModalOpen, setContactModalOpen] = useState<boolean>(false);\\n  const [codeZipModalOpen, setCodeZipModalOpen] = useState<boolean>(false);\\n  const [prefillContact, setPrefillContact] = useState<{\\n    serviceName?: string;\\n    vehicleType?: string;\\n    totalEstimate?: number;\\n  } | undefined>(undefined);\\n\\n  const handleBookService = (serviceName: string) => {\\n    setPrefillContact({ serviceName });\\n    setContactModalOpen(true);\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleOpenCalculatorBooking = (data: {\\n    vehicleType: string;\\n    serviceTier: string;\\n    totalEstimate: number;\\n  }) => {\\n    setPrefillContact({\\n      serviceName: data.serviceTier,\\n      vehicleType: data.vehicleType,\\n      totalEstimate: data.totalEstimate,\\n    });\\n    setContactModalOpen(true);\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleExplore360 = () => {\\n    const el = document.getElementById(\'inspection360\');\\n    if (el) {\\n      el.scrollIntoView({ behavior: \'smooth\' });\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"min-h-screen bg-[#07090e] text-[#e2e8f0] selection:bg-[#00f0ff] selection:text-[#07090e]\\\">\\n      {/* Sticky Header with 3 Divisions (Requirement 5 & 9) */}\\n      <Header\\n        onOpenContact={() => {\\n          setPrefillContact(undefined);\\n          setContactModalOpen(true);\\n        }}\\n        onOpenCodeZip={() => setCodeZipModalOpen(true)}\\n      />\\n\\n      <main>\\n        {/* Section 01: Hero Mission Hub */}\\n        <HeroSection\\n          onOpenContact={() => {\\n            setPrefillContact(undefined);\\n            setContactModalOpen(true);\\n          }}\\n          onExplore360={handleExplore360}\\n        />\\n\\n        {/* Section 02: 360\302\260 Rotatable Car Visualizer & Hotspot Enhancement (Requirement 13) */}\\n        <Car360Viewer\\n          onSelectHotspot={(hotspot) => setSelectedHotspot(hotspot)}\\n        />\\n\\n        {/* Section 03: Core Engineering & Diagnostics Matrix */}\\n        <ServicesSection onBookService={handleBookService} />\\n\\n        {/* Section 04: Robotic Cleanroom Bays & Live Sensor Feeds */}\\n        <TechBaySection />\\n\\n        {/* Section 05: Transparent Service Terminal & Estimator */}\\n        <CostCalculatorSection onOpenBookingModal={handleOpenCalculatorBooking} />\\n\\n        {/* Section 06: Client Telemetry, Guarantee & FAQ */}\\n        <TestimonialsFaqSection />\\n      </main>\\n\\n      {/* Professional Futuristic Footer (Requirement 7) */}\\n      <Footer\\n        onOpenContact={() => {\\n          setPrefillContact(undefined);\\n          setContactModalOpen(true);\\n        }}\\n      />\\n\\n      {/* Before & After Service Enhancement Popup (Requirement 13) */}\\n      <BeforeAfterModal\\n        hotspot={selectedHotspot}\\n        onClose={() => setSelectedHotspot(null)}\\n        onBookService={handleBookService}\\n      />\\n\\n      {/* Reserve Priority Service Dock Modal */}\\n      <ContactModal\\n        isOpen={contactModalOpen}\\n        onClose={() => setContactModalOpen(false)}\\n        prefillData={prefillContact}\\n      />\\n\\n      {/* Code Preview & 1-Click ZIP Download Modal (Requirement 11) */}\\n      <CodePreviewAndZipModal\\n        isOpen={codeZipModalOpen}\\n        onClose={() => setCodeZipModalOpen(false)}\\n      />\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n}\\n\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/App.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating App.tsx with integrated sections and modal handlers\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update App.tsx\"}"
      thought_signature: ""
      original_name: "create_file"
