  planner_response {
    response: "I have built the futuristic professional static webpage for **GK Services**, incorporating all specified conditions, responsive typography breakpoints, cybernetic dual-color palette, universal hover dynamics, and the interactive 360\302\260 vehicle inspection experience.\n\n### Key Highlights & Functional Overview\n\n- **Aesthetic Identity & Dual Color Palette**: Built on a high-contrast futuristic foundation pairing **Electric Cyber Cyan** (`#00F0FF`) with **Deep Void Obsidian** (`#07090E`), accented by aerospace titanium gray and subtle plasma amber telemetry accents.\n- **Responsive Typography Scale**: Configured four distinct responsive device breakpoints for font hierarchy:\n  - *Desktop (>1200px)*: High-impact display headings and spacious typography.\n  - *Tablet Landscape (>1024px)*: Scaled headers with full horizontal telemetry bar.\n  - *Tablet Portrait (768px \342\200\223 1024px)*: Fluid medium-density sizing.\n  - *Mobile (<767px)*: Optimized compact scale for maximum legibility.\n  - Typographic pairing combines **Orbitron** (display/headings), **Rajdhani** (technical sub-headings), **Inter** (clean body text), and **JetBrains Mono** (precision telemetry).\n- **Sticky 3-Division Header**: Fixed at the top with glassmorphism and laser border accents:\n  1. *Division 1*: Cybernetic **GK** emblem and active facility version indicator.\n  2. *Division 2*: Dynamic navigation menu with active section detection and live pulse indicators.\n  3. *Division 3*: Universal **Connect Bay** contact button with glowing neon laser sweep.\n  - *Responsive Hamburger*: Automatically collapses into a slide-down HUD drawer on tablet and mobile screens.\n- **Universal Button & Container Hover Dynamics**:\n  - *Universal Button Hover*: Neon laser border, luminous light sweep, and inverse color activation universally shared across all action buttons.\n  - *Container Y-Axis -30px Lift*: Key containers, feature cards, and inspection modules smoothly translate `-30px` on the Y-axis on hover (`translateY(-30px)`) accompanied by an electric cyan glow.\n- **6 Engaging & Distinct Sections**:\n  1. **Section 01 \302\267 Hero Mission Hub**: High-impact introduction featuring live dock status, laser scan telemetry, quick action buttons, and three foundational metric cards.\n  2. **Section 02 \302\267 360\302\260 Hyper-Inspection Studio**: Playful multi-perspective vehicle visualizer where users can drag, scroll, or use angle controls to orbit the car 360 degrees. Includes 6 interactive glowing hotspot pins (Ceramic Paint, Brembo Brakes, Matrix Optics, Twin-Turbo Intake, Carbon Aero Diffuser, Monobloc Wheels) that open the interactive **Before & After Service Enhancement Popup** featuring an interactive reveal slider, condition scores, and laboratory telemetry.\n  3. **Section 03 \302\267 Core Engineering & Diagnostics Matrix**: 6 distinct maintenance pillars with laser frequencies, tolerance standards, and instant booking triggers.\n  4. **Section 04 \302\267 Robotic Bays & Cleanroom Stack**: Interactive chamber console with real-time status switcher (Laser Dock, Zero-Gravity Fluids, Molecular Curing Vault, Quantum Dyno) with sensor telemetry gauges and live video stream.\n  5. **Section 05 \302\267 Service Terminal & Estimator**: Interactive calculator allowing visitors to choose their vehicle architecture, enhancement tiers, and autonomous upgrades with real-time cost computation and dock reservation locking.\n  6. **Section 06 \302\267 Client Telemetry, Guarantee & FAQ**: Verified customer track reports, the GK Zero-Tolerance Guarantee standard, and an interactive FAQ accordion.\n- **Professional Footer**: Complete with facility address, GPS coordinates, 24/7 recovery dispatch telephone, operating hours, certifications, and a telemetry bulletin newsletter.\n- **In-App Code Inspector & 1-Click ZIP Downloader**: Accessible via the header, opening a code viewer with syntax tabs and an instant **\"Download Complete ZIP\"** feature that bundles all source files into a standalone, easily editable `.zip` archive."
    thinking: "**Verifying Compliance Achieved**\n\nI\'ve confirmed the build\'s success! Now I\'m meticulously cross-referencing all user instructions and requirements to guarantee full compliance. Specifically, I\'m verifying the \"GK Services\" car service center elements\342\200\224high-tech branding, mission hub, and cleanroom bays\342\200\224are correctly implemented. Also, I\'m checking the responsive sizing for desktop devices and considering tablet and mobile next.\n\n\n**Confirming Global Attributes**\n\nI\'m now integrating crucial global attributes. I\'ve successfully implemented responsive font sizing with Orbitron, Rajdhani, Inter, and JetBrains Mono across multiple device sizes, defined in `src/index.css`. The color palette uses High-voltage Cyber Cyan and Deep Void Obsidian, accented with Titanium Steel. I\'ve also outlined the structure of the static page with its 6 sections, plus a sticky header with a futuristic logo, navigation, and contact button, which will have universal hovering effects.\n\n\n**Implementing Universal Design**\n\nMy focus is now on ensuring a consistent and engaging user experience across all sections. I\'m excited because the \"Connect Bay\" button now boasts glowing hover effects, universally shared via `.gk-btn`. I\'m also implementing the hover effect `.gk-hover-lift` to cards, boxes, inspection modules, chambers, and calculator blocks. This uses the Y-axis shift and cyan glow shadow. Lastly, I\'m working to make the navigation adaptive.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have built the futuristic professional static webpage for **GK Services**, incorporating all specified conditions, responsive typography breakpoints, cybernetic dual-color palette, universal hover dynamics, and the interactive 360\302\260 vehicle inspection experience.\n\n### Key Highlights & Functional Overview\n\n- **Aesthetic Identity & Dual Color Palette**: Built on a high-contrast futuristic foundation pairing **Electric Cyber Cyan** (`#00F0FF`) with **Deep Void Obsidian** (`#07090E`), accented by aerospace titanium gray and subtle plasma amber telemetry accents.\n- **Responsive Typography Scale**: Configured four distinct responsive device breakpoints for font hierarchy:\n  - *Desktop (>1200px)*: High-impact display headings and spacious typography.\n  - *Tablet Landscape (>1024px)*: Scaled headers with full horizontal telemetry bar.\n  - *Tablet Portrait (768px \342\200\223 1024px)*: Fluid medium-density sizing.\n  - *Mobile (<767px)*: Optimized compact scale for maximum legibility.\n  - Typographic pairing combines **Orbitron** (display/headings), **Rajdhani** (technical sub-headings), **Inter** (clean body text), and **JetBrains Mono** (precision telemetry).\n- **Sticky 3-Division Header**: Fixed at the top with glassmorphism and laser border accents:\n  1. *Division 1*: Cybernetic **GK** emblem and active facility version indicator.\n  2. *Division 2*: Dynamic navigation menu with active section detection and live pulse indicators.\n  3. *Division 3*: Universal **Connect Bay** contact button with glowing neon laser sweep.\n  - *Responsive Hamburger*: Automatically collapses into a slide-down HUD drawer on tablet and mobile screens.\n- **Universal Button & Container Hover Dynamics**:\n  - *Universal Button Hover*: Neon laser border, luminous light sweep, and inverse color activation universally shared across all action buttons.\n  - *Container Y-Axis -30px Lift*: Key containers, feature cards, and inspection modules smoothly translate `-30px` on the Y-axis on hover (`translateY(-30px)`) accompanied by an electric cyan glow.\n- **6 Engaging & Distinct Sections**:\n  1. **Section 01 \302\267 Hero Mission Hub**: High-impact introduction featuring live dock status, laser scan telemetry, quick action buttons, and three foundational metric cards.\n  2. **Section 02 \302\267 360\302\260 Hyper-Inspection Studio**: Playful multi-perspective vehicle visualizer where users can drag, scroll, or use angle controls to orbit the car 360 degrees. Includes 6 interactive glowing hotspot pins (Ceramic Paint, Brembo Brakes, Matrix Optics, Twin-Turbo Intake, Carbon Aero Diffuser, Monobloc Wheels) that open the interactive **Before & After Service Enhancement Popup** featuring an interactive reveal slider, condition scores, and laboratory telemetry.\n  3. **Section 03 \302\267 Core Engineering & Diagnostics Matrix**: 6 distinct maintenance pillars with laser frequencies, tolerance standards, and instant booking triggers.\n  4. **Section 04 \302\267 Robotic Bays & Cleanroom Stack**: Interactive chamber console with real-time status switcher (Laser Dock, Zero-Gravity Fluids, Molecular Curing Vault, Quantum Dyno) with sensor telemetry gauges and live video stream.\n  5. **Section 05 \302\267 Service Terminal & Estimator**: Interactive calculator allowing visitors to choose their vehicle architecture, enhancement tiers, and autonomous upgrades with real-time cost computation and dock reservation locking.\n  6. **Section 06 \302\267 Client Telemetry, Guarantee & FAQ**: Verified customer track reports, the GK Zero-Tolerance Guarantee standard, and an interactive FAQ accordion.\n- **Professional Footer**: Complete with facility address, GPS coordinates, 24/7 recovery dispatch telephone, operating hours, certifications, and a telemetry bulletin newsletter.\n- **In-App Code Inspector & 1-Click ZIP Downloader**: Accessible via the header, opening a code viewer with syntax tabs and an instant **\"Download Complete ZIP\"** feature that bundles all source files into a standalone, easily editable `.zip` archive."
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 1
      nanos: 740101181
