  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Considering Font Choices**\n\nI\'m currently weighing options for the new primary font, with `Michroma` and `Chakra Petch` as frontrunners. I\'ve loaded both into the project to test them. `Michroma`\'s wide, futuristic look is appealing.\n\n\n**Developing Theme Designs**\n\nI\'ve been working on the theme structure now, starting with a user request for light and dark modes. I\'ve drafted detailed color systems for both, including background, text, and accent colors. The dark mode utilizes a deep, futuristic palette. The light mode uses a clean, high-tech palette, with sharp and crisp contrasting colors that will provide a glowing shadow on various elements.\n\n\n**Implementing Scroll Interaction**\n\nI\'ve just added a back-to-top button with scroll percentage display, positioned at the bottom-right. It shows a circular progress ring with the exact percentage and an up arrow. Hovering reveals \"Back to Top,\" and clicking triggers a smooth scroll to the top. I\'m also looking at a 360-degree car viewer.\n\n\n**Defining Car Viewer Angles**\n\nI\'m now diving into the specifics of the 360-degree car viewer. I\'ve broken down the viewing angles, including eye-level orbits with 0 to 360 degrees and top-down and undercarriage perspectives. This will give users a comprehensive look at the car\'s design, from the carbon roof down to the undertray. I\'m also planning mode switcher buttons to easily toggle between views.\n\n\n"
