  planner_response {
    response: "I have completed the enhancements for **GK Services - Futuristic Car Service Center**, addressing all requirements:\n\n- **Theme Engine (Opposite & Compatible Light / Dark)**:\n  - Designed a dual-palette architecture powered by CSS variables (`:root` and `html.dark`).\n  - **Dark Mode**: Cyber Neon Cyan (`#00F0FF`) on Deep Void Obsidian (`#07090E`).\n  - **Light Mode**: High-contrast sterile lab theme featuring a crisp cool slate canvas (`#F1F5F9`), pure elevated white bays, electric cobalt accents (`#0284C7`), and deep slate typography.\n  - Added a dedicated theme toggle switch in the sticky navigation header with smooth transitions and state persistence.\n\n- **Single-Car 360\302\260 Multi-Elevation Inspection Studio**:\n  - Isolated single-car model presentation with zero background clutter.\n  - **360\302\260 Horizontal Orbit**: Smooth rotation across 8 precision perspectives (0\302\260 to 315\302\260) via mouse drag, touch scrub, angle selector chips, or continuous auto-rotation.\n  - **Chassis Under-Car View**: Dedicated sub-chassis inspection showing the aerodynamic venturi tunnels, titanium skid pucks, and exhaust manifold with interactive telemetry hotspots.\n  - **Canopy Over-Car View**: Aerial roof inspection displaying carbon weave, solar flux, and aero channel health.\n  - **Before & After Enhancement Modal**: Interactive split-slider and side-by-side diagnostic modes comparing degraded components with restored parts.\n\n- **Back to Top with Scroll Percentage**:\n  - Positioned a floating, circular control at the bottom right.\n  - Renders a live SVG circular progress ring displaying real-time scroll depth percentage.\n  - Transforms into an animated upward arrow on hover and smoothly scrolls the viewport to the top when clicked.\n\n- **Futuristic Typographic Refresh**:\n  - Updated the primary display and heading typography to **Chakra Petch** and **Michroma**.\n  - Retained strict responsive font scaling across all device breakpoints (Desktop `>1200px`, Tablet `>1024px`, Mobile `>767px`).\n\n- **Universal Hover Dynamics & Sticky Navigation**:\n  - Applied the universal `-30px` y-axis container hover lift (`transform: translateY(-30px)`) across all key cards.\n  - Preserved the sticky 3-division header with responsive hamburger mobile drawer, the 6 distinct technical sections, and the complete 1-click project ZIP exporter."
    thinking: "**Verifying Completion**\n\nI\'ve successfully compiled the applet without any errors! Now, I\'m meticulously double-checking every requirement. \"Gk Services,\" the car service center, is fully branded across all relevant sections, headers, and cards. I\'m aiming for complete satisfaction.\n\n\n**Defining Responsive Styling**\n\nNow, I\'m defining the responsive styling. I\'ve established size breakpoints for desktop, tablet, and mobile, using media queries in `src/index.css`. The primary fonts are now set to Chakra Petch and Michroma, paired with Rajdhani and JetBrains Mono. I\'ve also implemented the global color palette with dark and light themes accessible via CSS variables, ensuring the light theme is a complete contrast to the dark.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have completed the enhancements for **GK Services - Futuristic Car Service Center**, addressing all requirements:\n\n- **Theme Engine (Opposite & Compatible Light / Dark)**:\n  - Designed a dual-palette architecture powered by CSS variables (`:root` and `html.dark`).\n  - **Dark Mode**: Cyber Neon Cyan (`#00F0FF`) on Deep Void Obsidian (`#07090E`).\n  - **Light Mode**: High-contrast sterile lab theme featuring a crisp cool slate canvas (`#F1F5F9`), pure elevated white bays, electric cobalt accents (`#0284C7`), and deep slate typography.\n  - Added a dedicated theme toggle switch in the sticky navigation header with smooth transitions and state persistence.\n\n- **Single-Car 360\302\260 Multi-Elevation Inspection Studio**:\n  - Isolated single-car model presentation with zero background clutter.\n  - **360\302\260 Horizontal Orbit**: Smooth rotation across 8 precision perspectives (0\302\260 to 315\302\260) via mouse drag, touch scrub, angle selector chips, or continuous auto-rotation.\n  - **Chassis Under-Car View**: Dedicated sub-chassis inspection showing the aerodynamic venturi tunnels, titanium skid pucks, and exhaust manifold with interactive telemetry hotspots.\n  - **Canopy Over-Car View**: Aerial roof inspection displaying carbon weave, solar flux, and aero channel health.\n  - **Before & After Enhancement Modal**: Interactive split-slider and side-by-side diagnostic modes comparing degraded components with restored parts.\n\n- **Back to Top with Scroll Percentage**:\n  - Positioned a floating, circular control at the bottom right.\n  - Renders a live SVG circular progress ring displaying real-time scroll depth percentage.\n  - Transforms into an animated upward arrow on hover and smoothly scrolls the viewport to the top when clicked.\n\n- **Futuristic Typographic Refresh**:\n  - Updated the primary display and heading typography to **Chakra Petch** and **Michroma**.\n  - Retained strict responsive font scaling across all device breakpoints (Desktop `>1200px`, Tablet `>1024px`, Mobile `>767px`).\n\n- **Universal Hover Dynamics & Sticky Navigation**:\n  - Applied the universal `-30px` y-axis container hover lift (`transform: translateY(-30px)`) across all key cards.\n  - Preserved the sticky 3-division header with responsive hamburger mobile drawer, the 6 distinct technical sections, and the complete 1-click project ZIP exporter."
