  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing 3D Model**\n\nI\'m now diving into Requirement 6, specifically the interactive 3D model for the car\'s 360 rotation. I\'m focusing on the component `Car3DCanvas.tsx` and building its base features. It will feature a 3D model of the car.\n\n\n**Implementing Car Features**\n\nMy focus has shifted to the aerodynamic model\'s details within the `Car3DCanvas.tsx`. I\'m building a high-detail, procedurally generated car prototype, including the monocoque body, front nose cone, side air intakes, underbody venturi channels, rear diffuser, and high-mount wing. I\'m working on applying glossy metallic paint finishes with realistic reflections using `THREE.MeshStandardMaterial` or `THREE.MeshPhysicalMaterial`. I\'ve started defining color schemes such as Apex Cobalt and Void Matte Obsidian.\n\n\n**Adding Wheel Detailing**\n\nI\'m now detailing the four wheels, focusing on their specific features. This includes realistic rubber tires with tread, multi-spoke alloy wheels, cross-drilled ceramic brake discs, and high-visibility neon brake calipers. I\'m aiming for high fidelity. I\'m also planning the ground presentation details such as holographic turntable rings, shadow disks, and subtle grid lines for presentation.\n\n\n**Developing Camera Controls**\n\nI\'m now implementing interactive camera controls for the 3D model. I\'m focusing on smooth zoom with inertia, auto-rotation with a turntable orbit, and quick camera angle presets for diverse viewing perspectives. I\'ve designed presets for front, side, rear, top, and under views. Next, I plan to develop 3D telemetry hotspots.\n\n**Integrating Telemetry Hotspots**\n\nI\'m working on adding interactive 3D telemetry hotspots to the model. I\'m mapping 3D vector positions to car parts like the front laser scanner, wheel assembly, aerodynamic wing, ground-effect diffuser, and cockpit. These hotspots will display relevant information when clicked. Currently, I\'m working to project these 3D positions into screen coordinates for each render frame.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 27
      nanos: 967476677
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
