  planner_response {
    response: "I have completed all requested updates and refinements for **GK Services**:\n\n- **Floating Theme Toggle Positioned Above Back-to-Top**:\n  - Relocated the Light/Dark mode switcher to float directly above the Back-to-Top button with live circular scroll percentage telemetry. Both controls remain anchored at the bottom-right for intuitive access.\n\n- **Responsive Font & Text Sizing Across Breakpoints**:\n  - Calibrated global typography scales using responsive CSS clamp values and targeted media query brackets (Desktop `>1200px`, Tablet `>1024px`, Mobile `\342\211\244767px`), ensuring balanced line heights, legibility, and proportional headings on all screen sizes.\n\n- **Mobile Header & Offcanvas Navigation**:\n  - **Mobile View**: The top header now strictly contains **only** the GK company logo and the hamburger menu toggle.\n  - **Offcanvas Drawer**: Tapping the hamburger menu triggers a dedicated offcanvas sliding drawer with navigation sectors, live facility telemetry, a dock booking trigger, and the source code export tool.\n\n- **Distinct Light vs. Dark Color Palette & Typography**:\n  - **Dark Mode**: Retains the Cyberpunk Titanium aesthetic with void black backgrounds (`#080a10`), high-contrast neon cyan accents (`#00f0ff`), and technical Orbitron/Space Grotesk typography.\n  - **Light Mode**: Re-engineered with an Aerospace Studio palette featuring crisp laboratory neutrals (`#f4f6fa`), deep cobalt primary tones (`#1d4ed8`), slate typography, and Plus Jakarta Sans body styling.\n\n- **Interactive 3D WebGL Model for Car Inspection**:\n  - Built an isolated prototype vehicle in **Three.js** with physical clearcoat paint finishes, tinted cockpit glass, carbon-fiber aerodynamics, and cross-drilled ceramic brake assemblies.\n  - **Full 3D Orbital Freedom**: Drag or swipe to rotate 360\302\260 sideways, view over the aerial canopy (+75\302\260), or look under the sub-chassis venturi diffuser (-35\302\260).\n  - **Diagnostic Tools**: Features interactive 3D telemetry hotspots projected onto the vehicle, real-time LiDAR wireframe mode, 6 automotive paint finishes (Apex Cobalt, Cyber Neon, Titanium Silver, Obsidian, Crimson, Solar Gold), and quick camera angle presets."
    modified_response: "I have completed all requested updates and refinements for **GK Services**:\n\n- **Floating Theme Toggle Positioned Above Back-to-Top**:\n  - Relocated the Light/Dark mode switcher to float directly above the Back-to-Top button with live circular scroll percentage telemetry. Both controls remain anchored at the bottom-right for intuitive access.\n\n- **Responsive Font & Text Sizing Across Breakpoints**:\n  - Calibrated global typography scales using responsive CSS clamp values and targeted media query brackets (Desktop `>1200px`, Tablet `>1024px`, Mobile `\342\211\244767px`), ensuring balanced line heights, legibility, and proportional headings on all screen sizes.\n\n- **Mobile Header & Offcanvas Navigation**:\n  - **Mobile View**: The top header now strictly contains **only** the GK company logo and the hamburger menu toggle.\n  - **Offcanvas Drawer**: Tapping the hamburger menu triggers a dedicated offcanvas sliding drawer with navigation sectors, live facility telemetry, a dock booking trigger, and the source code export tool.\n\n- **Distinct Light vs. Dark Color Palette & Typography**:\n  - **Dark Mode**: Retains the Cyberpunk Titanium aesthetic with void black backgrounds (`#080a10`), high-contrast neon cyan accents (`#00f0ff`), and technical Orbitron/Space Grotesk typography.\n  - **Light Mode**: Re-engineered with an Aerospace Studio palette featuring crisp laboratory neutrals (`#f4f6fa`), deep cobalt primary tones (`#1d4ed8`), slate typography, and Plus Jakarta Sans body styling.\n\n- **Interactive 3D WebGL Model for Car Inspection**:\n  - Built an isolated prototype vehicle in **Three.js** with physical clearcoat paint finishes, tinted cockpit glass, carbon-fiber aerodynamics, and cross-drilled ceramic brake assemblies.\n  - **Full 3D Orbital Freedom**: Drag or swipe to rotate 360\302\260 sideways, view over the aerial canopy (+75\302\260), or look under the sub-chassis venturi diffuser (-35\302\260).\n  - **Diagnostic Tools**: Features interactive 3D telemetry hotspots projected onto the vehicle, real-time LiDAR wireframe mode, 6 automotive paint finishes (Apex Cobalt, Cyber Neon, Titanium Silver, Obsidian, Crimson, Solar Gold), and quick camera angle presets."
