    thinking: "**Envisioning a Workshop**\n\nI\'m incredibly excited about the potential of `Car3DCanvas.tsx`. It\'s so clean, I immediately envision it as the foundation for an engaging, interactive 3D Car Customizer workshop, maybe \"GK Interactive 3D Vehicle Customizer Studio\"! I can\'t wait to see the details of the request.\n\n\n**Exploring Customizations Deeply**\n\nI\'m now diving deep into customization options! We can offer a wide array of choices: vibrant body paint colors like Cyber Cyan and Stealth Matte Obsidian, with various finishes, plus a curated selection of rims \342\200\223 from classic 5-spokes to Aero-Turbine Discs, each with their own unique color options. Finally, we\'ll offer Racing Slicks for tires! I\'m really envisioning how this will make the workshop interactive.\n\n\n**Expanding Customization Options**\n\nI\'ve been further expanding the customization possibilities. Now, I\'m considering grooved track tires, neon rings around the tire sidewall, and heavy all-weather treads. I\'ve also thought about brake caliper colors: neon cyan, Brembo red, and more. For spoilers, I\'m imagining high-downforce wings, ducktail lips, and cyber split-wing active aero. I\'m also thinking of neon underglow options and interactive play elements, such as engine revving and headlight toggles!\n\n\n"
